    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> equals:</p>"
